WEBVTT

00:28.670 --> 00:30.000
C'mon, hit me!

01:02.040 --> 01:04.460
Speed that outstrips lightning.

01:04.460 --> 01:06.290
The strength of a demonic sword.

01:07.170 --> 01:09.000
And unlimited magic power!

01:09.710 --> 01:11.790
I've kept you waiting, Gilzea!

01:11.790 --> 01:13.540
I'll kill you,

01:13.540 --> 01:16.080
and then I'll kill the Dragon God!

01:17.540 --> 01:19.040
Dragon Hunting...

01:20.830 --> 01:21.830
Flash!

01:27.290 --> 01:29.960
Gill the Dragon Gawd?

01:31.080 --> 01:33.330
Silver Sword!

01:34.130 --> 01:35.420
Recreate Form!

01:37.920 --> 01:40.500
You won't ged the chance to!

01:40.500 --> 01:43.250
You're gonna die righd here!

01:47.040 --> 01:48.250
All right.

01:48.960 --> 01:51.420
I'll play with you a little more.

01:51.670 --> 01:53.210
How will you best me?

01:53.210 --> 01:54.040
In strength?

01:54.040 --> 01:55.460
In speed?

01:55.460 --> 01:56.630
In skill?

01:56.630 --> 02:01.460
Apparently, your strength is
running your mouth.

02:04.420 --> 02:05.580
Come.

02:05.580 --> 02:07.790
I'll show you my Anti-Monarch Move.

02:07.790 --> 02:10.040
That's what he did before!

02:10.210 --> 02:13.580
That's the only blow that's ever
surpassed my speed.

02:13.580 --> 02:17.710
But it immediately wrecked his body,
and he couldn't fight.

02:17.710 --> 02:22.170
I suspect it's a self-destructive move
that exhausts all his power in one strike.

02:22.170 --> 02:23.580
That's no problem.

02:23.580 --> 02:25.580
I can deal with it in my current state.

02:26.330 --> 02:27.500
Come?

02:27.500 --> 02:29.500
I think you mean,
"Please come here, sir."

02:39.130 --> 02:42.830
Kamui!

02:44.790 --> 02:47.170
Keep out of this!

02:47.170 --> 02:48.210
Fine.

02:48.210 --> 02:50.630
I'll face you head-on and pulverize you!

03:22.580 --> 03:24.460
Ikiru imi sae

03:24.460 --> 03:26.630
Ubaisatteitta

03:26.630 --> 03:28.830
Ibitsuna sekai o

03:28.830 --> 03:31.630
Zenbu kowasou to shiteita

03:31.630 --> 03:33.710
(Subete o hikikae ni)

03:33.710 --> 03:35.880
Chikara o motometa

03:35.880 --> 03:38.000
(Daishou no hate ni)

03:38.000 --> 03:41.000
Nani ga matteita toshitemo

03:41.420 --> 03:45.460
Mirai o kaeru tame ni

03:45.460 --> 03:48.500
Jibun o tokihanatte

03:48.500 --> 03:50.670
Kotae wa dare ni mo

03:50.670 --> 03:52.790
Wakari nado shinai

03:52.790 --> 03:54.630
Dakara jibun de

03:54.630 --> 03:56.920
Kirihiraite yukunda

03:57.210 --> 03:59.250
Aragai nagara

03:59.250 --> 04:01.500
Sagashite ita mono wa

04:01.500 --> 04:05.250
Kibou demo kiseki demo naku tada

04:05.250 --> 04:07.250
Boku wa ima

04:07.250 --> 04:12.830
Kimi to ikiru imi ga hoshii dake

04:26.040 --> 04:28.670
<b>Episode 24: Light</b>

04:30.170 --> 04:32.380
Now I'll take things to the next level!

04:33.330 --> 04:37.080
On top of Lightning God Battle Arts,
I'll stack Dragonization!

04:38.540 --> 04:39.920
The power of a dragon!

04:39.920 --> 04:41.330
The power of a demonic sword!

04:41.330 --> 04:43.460
All the spoils of my victories!

04:43.460 --> 04:48.540
Just as the sun rises in the east
and sets in the west, I am absolute.

04:50.290 --> 04:54.540
Now, I'm capable of crushing the rising sun!

04:55.210 --> 04:56.880
What makes something absolute?

04:57.250 --> 04:59.880
Being able to hunt any dragon
would be truly absolute.

05:00.460 --> 05:02.080
Hunting Flash isn't enough.

05:02.540 --> 05:03.880
I need to further hone it!

05:03.880 --> 05:05.540
Faster than sound,

05:05.540 --> 05:07.250
faster than lightning,

05:07.250 --> 05:09.000
and instantaneous...

05:09.380 --> 05:10.460
Light!

05:12.080 --> 05:13.960
A two-part attack at the speed of light!

05:15.630 --> 05:17.420
Twin Hunting Flash!

05:27.250 --> 05:29.500
An absolute attack
that brings absolute death.

05:29.500 --> 05:32.960
They've reached the level
it takes to kill me.

05:33.540 --> 05:35.130
Therefore...

05:35.580 --> 05:38.830
It's a shame, lightning genius.

05:39.580 --> 05:42.830
You overwhelmed all your foes with speed,

05:42.830 --> 05:46.250
but in the end, you were defeated by speed.

05:48.000 --> 05:52.130
It's way faster than the previous version
and hits twice?

05:53.460 --> 05:57.580
I've stolen every kind of strength
and made it mine.

05:57.580 --> 05:59.880
But I can't steal this!

05:59.880 --> 06:03.920
I can't even fathom how he was able
to achieve such a technique!

06:06.080 --> 06:07.880
Guess I've lost.

06:13.540 --> 06:17.170
I didn't ever get to repay
that debt, in the end.

06:17.170 --> 06:17.790
Kamui!

06:17.790 --> 06:19.000
But,

06:19.000 --> 06:22.500
I'll shatter the odds of you dying to bits.

06:38.170 --> 06:39.330
Ka...

06:40.250 --> 06:41.580
...mui?

06:45.460 --> 06:47.130
W-wait.

06:47.130 --> 06:48.750
No, wait.

06:49.170 --> 06:50.420
Kamui!

06:50.790 --> 06:53.130
Stop... Stop!

06:53.500 --> 06:57.380
Stop!

07:05.170 --> 07:06.790
Time stopped?

07:07.330 --> 07:08.830
It stopped!

07:10.460 --> 07:12.250
I've got my powers back!

07:12.250 --> 07:13.330
Kamui!

07:13.330 --> 07:14.290
Elder!

07:14.290 --> 07:15.460
Nebulim!

07:15.460 --> 07:16.710
Zora!

07:16.710 --> 07:18.380
Everything's okay now!

07:18.380 --> 07:21.830
I can make it to where this end
never happened!

07:22.670 --> 07:23.790
Now!

07:23.790 --> 07:26.000
Heed me, all creation! And retu-

07:27.670 --> 07:28.670
Huh?

07:36.380 --> 07:38.000
It stopped!

07:38.790 --> 07:40.000
Situation uncertain.

07:40.000 --> 07:40.250
Situation uncertain.

07:40.000 --> 07:40.250
I've got my powers back!

07:40.250 --> 07:41.710
Are there other survivors?

07:40.250 --> 07:41.710
I've got my powers back!

07:41.710 --> 07:42.460
Are there other survivors?

07:41.710 --> 07:42.460
Kamui!

07:42.460 --> 07:42.750
If I'm the only one left,
then I'll see it through to the end!

07:42.460 --> 07:42.750
Kamui!

07:42.750 --> 07:45.750
If I'm the only one left,
then I'll see it through to the end!

07:42.750 --> 07:45.750
Elder! Nebulim! Zora!

07:46.170 --> 07:48.000
Everything's okay now!

07:48.000 --> 07:51.290
I can make it to where this end
never happened!

07:51.750 --> 07:55.080
But if I let her rewind time,

07:56.040 --> 07:58.170
I can see everyone again.

07:59.330 --> 08:02.540
I just have to not pull the trigger.

08:25.000 --> 08:26.540
No!

08:28.960 --> 08:30.080
Hey!

08:30.080 --> 08:31.500
Wake up!

08:31.500 --> 08:32.330
Hey!

08:37.670 --> 08:39.290
Wh-what are you doing?

08:39.290 --> 08:41.210
I ain't gonna hurt you.

08:41.210 --> 08:44.040
I only brought you here to talk.

08:46.000 --> 08:49.540
Hey, don't go too far or you'll fall.

08:50.630 --> 08:52.210
We're up on a cliff.

08:54.040 --> 08:55.290
So high!

08:55.290 --> 08:57.630
I'll bring you back
when we're done talking.

08:57.630 --> 08:58.710
Now...

08:58.710 --> 09:00.210
Tell me your wish.

09:00.750 --> 09:02.830
What are you talking about?

09:02.830 --> 09:04.580
Your wish! Your heart's desire!

09:05.540 --> 09:08.670
I'll make one of your wishes come true!

09:08.670 --> 09:09.960
You gotta have a wish!

09:09.960 --> 09:13.000
You want someone killed,
something destroyed,

09:13.000 --> 09:15.000
or maybe something stolen for you?

09:15.920 --> 09:18.500
I do not have wishes like that!

09:19.040 --> 09:21.460
Why are you asking me such a thing?

09:21.790 --> 09:24.210
Because you put me in your debt!

09:25.920 --> 09:29.170
Th-then stop calling me ant-lady!

09:29.420 --> 09:31.790
No need to ask for that.
I won't anymore.

09:33.500 --> 09:36.750
Thank you... very much for that.

09:36.750 --> 09:38.710
Can't think of anything else?

09:38.710 --> 09:41.420
Then I'll decide for you.

09:42.290 --> 09:45.710
You said you wanted to save
whoever you wanna save...

09:46.380 --> 09:48.460
That's the heart of it, right?

09:49.880 --> 09:51.380
I've got it.

09:51.380 --> 09:55.710
Someday, I'm gonna free you from god.

10:04.670 --> 10:06.210
It's hot.

10:07.460 --> 10:10.460
I'll burn up.

10:11.460 --> 10:14.630
Must get... to shade.

10:26.290 --> 10:31.830
Do you have anything to say for yourself,
product number 19835?

10:32.580 --> 10:34.250
No, I apologize.

10:34.250 --> 10:36.830
Of course you do not.

10:37.170 --> 10:40.630
The fault lies entirely with me.

10:42.330 --> 10:46.330
I deemed you a very capable specimen.

10:47.000 --> 10:49.290
Your magic power reserve
and operational period

10:49.290 --> 10:51.670
exceed that of normal specimens by far.

10:51.670 --> 10:55.750
You greatly reminded me of the original
when she was alive.

10:55.750 --> 10:58.880
If I could mass produce
specimens like you,

10:58.880 --> 11:03.000
the church's military power
would tremendously increase.

11:03.170 --> 11:04.500
I'm so sorry.

11:04.880 --> 11:06.420
I'm so sorry.

11:07.040 --> 11:11.250
Therefore, I mass produced
immature specimens

11:11.250 --> 11:13.880
and entrusted their teaching to you.

11:14.420 --> 11:16.420
And this is the result.

11:17.080 --> 11:19.830
All the Carulas lost their minds.

11:20.170 --> 11:22.750
They disobeyed countless orders,

11:22.750 --> 11:26.290
which resulted in the collapse
of multiple war fronts.

11:26.630 --> 11:30.670
It was as if all of you were proclaiming,

11:30.670 --> 11:34.420
"The Sun God is not worthy of our belief."

11:34.420 --> 11:36.630
Then, there's the matter of
the Lightning Beast.

11:38.000 --> 11:40.170
The past eight years,

11:40.170 --> 11:43.580
the church has suffered monumental
damages because of that animal.

11:43.580 --> 11:48.420
An unbelievable amount of personnel,
supplies, and facilities were lost.

11:48.960 --> 11:52.380
If I had not learned of your
connection to the beast,

11:52.380 --> 11:55.290
we would have sustained
even greater damages.

11:55.500 --> 12:01.170
Behold. By using you as bait,
we have captured him at last.

12:01.170 --> 12:04.210
When pitted against
all the Dragon Scourges,

12:04.210 --> 12:07.920
not even a beast like him
can escape death.

12:10.170 --> 12:14.460
The Lightning Beast will die, and every
tainted Carula will be disposed of.

12:14.460 --> 12:18.580
Then, the church will be able
to move forward again.

12:20.880 --> 12:22.170
Why?

12:22.630 --> 12:25.830
Why did this come to pass?

12:26.880 --> 12:30.580
From that day forward,
I felt the slightest sense of optimism.

12:31.330 --> 12:34.670
Even though we were disposable,

12:34.670 --> 12:38.330
we could still mourn for ourselves.

12:39.210 --> 12:40.960
We could love ourselves.

12:41.420 --> 12:43.420
That's what I endeavored to teach them.

12:44.250 --> 12:50.130
Was that really such a wicked sin, God?

12:50.130 --> 12:52.330
Did you call me?

12:58.500 --> 13:00.420
Wh-who are you?

13:03.500 --> 13:06.130
Time stopped?

13:06.920 --> 13:11.040
I am that which is yet to exist.

13:11.040 --> 13:13.830
I am that which will one day be born.

13:14.250 --> 13:19.250
That which you would call
the Dragon God, dearest Big Sister!

13:19.540 --> 13:23.130
Th-the Dragon God?

13:23.960 --> 13:27.830
I could be your god as well
if you so desire.

13:28.420 --> 13:30.830
If you're a god...

13:31.540 --> 13:34.210
Then would you please save us?

13:34.580 --> 13:37.290
Would you please save him?

13:39.130 --> 13:42.750
I can actualize the world you desire
if you wish.

13:43.920 --> 13:45.630
I shall name you.

13:45.630 --> 13:47.040
Ultimatia. Meaning, "the wings of god."

13:48.420 --> 13:49.540
This is your fault!

13:49.540 --> 13:50.540
Why is this happening to us?

13:50.540 --> 13:51.290
This isn't fair!

13:51.290 --> 13:52.250
It hurts so much!

13:52.250 --> 13:53.130
This is all because of you.

13:53.130 --> 13:54.000
So much pain!

13:54.000 --> 13:54.750
Atone!

13:55.000 --> 13:56.040
Atone!

13:56.540 --> 13:57.330
Atone!

13:57.790 --> 13:58.790
Atone!

13:59.170 --> 14:01.920
Bring me into this world.

14:02.330 --> 14:05.330
If you're wishing for a miracle,
take my hand.

14:13.960 --> 14:16.420
G-God...

14:17.630 --> 14:23.920
Please hear my pleading.

14:25.040 --> 14:29.080
Once more, give me your salvation!

14:36.420 --> 14:38.330
Just as I thought.

14:39.080 --> 14:42.250
You no longer need me.

14:42.960 --> 14:47.290
Just as you cast this country aside,
now you're doing the same to me.

14:48.670 --> 14:50.580
I'm such a fool.

14:54.040 --> 14:55.830
But I...

14:59.040 --> 15:00.880
I will survive.

15:01.880 --> 15:06.330
I must... survive.

15:11.540 --> 15:14.250
How much longer will you live?

15:14.250 --> 15:15.290
Huh?

15:15.290 --> 15:17.130
I-I'm not sure.

15:17.710 --> 15:21.710
On average, our operational
period is four years.

15:22.210 --> 15:23.960
Which would leave me about a year...

15:23.960 --> 15:26.670
That's freakin' short! Live longer!

15:27.420 --> 15:29.420
Until I can repay my debt,

15:29.420 --> 15:32.710
you need to keep living
through willpower or whatever.

15:33.250 --> 15:36.040
If you decide to keel over before then,
I'll show you a real world of hurt!

15:37.630 --> 15:41.460
I was already gonna
destroy the church for fun,

15:41.460 --> 15:43.830
but now I'll get serious about it!

15:44.710 --> 15:48.040
Well, I won't keep you waiting long.

15:48.580 --> 15:51.290
Speed is my forte, after all.

15:52.170 --> 15:54.250
You're too slow...

15:55.000 --> 15:57.460
You idiot.

15:59.000 --> 16:04.790
You've kept me waiting for so long
that I've been driven mad.

16:06.630 --> 16:11.580
But I'll wait on you a little bit longer...

16:12.420 --> 16:18.630
Because now I remember what's
more important than anything.

16:24.420 --> 16:27.000
Oh, thank goodness.

16:27.000 --> 16:28.330
Shade.

16:30.170 --> 16:35.630
I'll rest here,
and once my wounds have healed,

16:36.580 --> 16:38.790
I'll rewind time.

16:40.290 --> 16:43.710
And so I wait once again.

16:50.250 --> 16:54.420
I was so happy when you
told me to live longer

16:54.420 --> 16:57.790
and that I was not allowed to die.

16:58.830 --> 17:02.000
I would wait, even if that meant
relying on god.

17:02.920 --> 17:08.540
I'd wait until the day when you would
free me from god.

17:13.830 --> 17:18.580
First, second, third,
and fourth walls locked.

17:18.750 --> 17:20.750
Alterphase seal complete.

17:35.920 --> 17:37.830
What a bloody victory.

17:54.040 --> 17:56.750
Do you feel any regret?

17:58.130 --> 17:59.500
I don't.

18:00.880 --> 18:02.880
I couldn't have won by myself.

18:04.500 --> 18:07.330
Without everyone else,
we wouldn't have won.

18:08.630 --> 18:10.380
So I don't feel regret.

18:12.960 --> 18:17.540
It would be insulting to everyone
if I did feel that way.

18:18.500 --> 18:19.630
But...

18:20.000 --> 18:21.630
I just feel sad.

18:24.170 --> 18:26.210
So what if you're sad?

18:28.170 --> 18:30.000
You throwing in the towel?

18:30.540 --> 18:33.170
Are you going to quit
trying to wipe out the dragons?

18:34.380 --> 18:35.790
I'm not.

18:37.000 --> 18:39.330
Sadness is something to endure.

18:40.790 --> 18:42.540
I will destroy dragonkind.

18:43.290 --> 18:45.710
Even if I have to do it alone.

18:47.000 --> 18:48.210
I see.

18:52.210 --> 18:53.960
Time to wake up.

19:01.170 --> 19:02.460
Yo!

19:03.040 --> 19:04.630
Come with me.

19:04.630 --> 19:06.500
I have something to show you.

19:53.170 --> 19:54.880
The poison is gone.

19:54.880 --> 19:59.080
What's more, the damage the poison
inflicted on her has entirely healed too.

20:01.920 --> 20:05.750
Physically, there is nothing wrong
with her anymore.

20:16.540 --> 20:21.000
Olto Zora's magic was creating
chemicals, not poison.

20:21.420 --> 20:22.750
Meaning...

20:24.170 --> 20:30.670
I wish I could give you more of a prize
than just my life.

20:36.250 --> 20:38.330
The person who healed Her Highness was...

20:41.540 --> 20:42.830
Ragna!

20:42.830 --> 20:46.750
Part ways with that filth
and be with me from now on!

20:47.210 --> 20:50.460
I will not allow such a wretched future
to befall you!

20:52.130 --> 20:54.500
She... survived!

20:55.170 --> 20:58.080
But there's no guarantee she'll wake up.

20:58.420 --> 20:59.170
Ow!

21:05.380 --> 21:08.040
I know she'll wake up.

21:09.130 --> 21:13.580
And then she'll make a sword for me again.

21:47.830 --> 21:48.960
Yo!

21:53.130 --> 21:54.500
You leaving?

21:55.290 --> 21:56.540
Yep.

21:56.540 --> 21:58.750
To hunt the next bloodline.

22:00.830 --> 22:01.920
Hey!

22:02.380 --> 22:03.920
I'll catch up in no time.

22:04.380 --> 22:05.670
Yeah, you will.

22:10.130 --> 22:11.830
I'll be waiting ahead.

22:26.170 --> 22:33.210
Honshou wa kakushiteiru tsubasa no uchi ni,
mudana agaki to shitte mo

22:33.210 --> 22:39.920
Kodoku kara naru itami sae taete izure
tayorinai mirai, kibou

22:39.920 --> 22:43.710
Raisan o kumo ni suru kuuchuusen,
yokkyuu oshikorosu koujou ja

22:43.710 --> 22:47.000
Ibitsuna katachi shika umi enai

22:47.000 --> 22:53.960
Akegata, higashi kara noboru hikari o
watashi no mono ni nante wagamama

22:53.960 --> 22:58.080
Aimaina kotoba ja todokanai hodo

22:58.080 --> 23:06.420
Kurakute mabushii tokoro made
shinjitai to dou ieba ii

23:07.080 --> 23:11.580
Hada de kanjita ima iki o tsuiteiru koto sae

23:11.580 --> 23:15.710
Houridaseru youna netsu ga mi o yaite mo

23:15.710 --> 23:22.290
Ano machi e kaeru tame
no hane ga mou sukoshi oshii

23:22.290 --> 23:29.790
Ah, kono mama doko made mo iketara
soko wa atatakai basho de

23:29.790 --> 23:34.500
Fureru ni wa mada yawarakai mama da
